    "objects": {
      "general": [
        {
          "properties": {
            "paragraphs": [
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Data Cleaning (Power Query)",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "20pt",
                      "color": "#d64550"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "center"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Approach",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "20pt",
                      "textDecoration": "underline",
                      "color": "#a1343c"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "The cleaning was written in M, the formula language of Power Query, instead of relying only on the point-and-click interface. M was used to work faster: every step is defined once in a single script, applied in one go, readable and editable as text, and it re-runs unchanged whenever the data is refreshed. It is a more advanced technique than the interface, adopted as part of a deliberate effort to keep developing technical skills.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "16pt"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "center"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "What was done",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "18pt",
                      "textDecoration": "underline",
                      "color": "#a1343c"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "- Imported the file correctly: read the semicolon-separated CSV, promoted the first row to headers and trimmed hidden spaces from every column.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "16pt"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "center"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "- Removed the type-descriptor row that sat under the headers, so that numeric columns were not forced to Text.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "16pt"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "center"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "- Fixed blanks and data types: converted empty cells to true null values and assigned a whole-number, decimal or text type to each column; 13 rate and percentage columns were locked to Decimal.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "16pt"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "center"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "- Removed non-country records: the European Union aggregate (it double-counts its member countries) and 31 uninhabited islands, reefs and territories with almost no indicators. The table went from 263 to 231 rows.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "16pt"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "center"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "- Standardized 15 country names (for example Korea South to South Korea, Burma to Myanmar) so that maps and slicers recognize them.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "16pt"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "center"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "- Kept missing values as null instead of zero, because zero means measured as zero and null means unknown.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "16pt"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "center"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "- Reviewed outliers and kept them (for example inflation in Zimbabwe, growth in Iraq), because they are real values; they will be handled in DAX with medians beside averages.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "16pt"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "center"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "- Added a Region column to support a regional slicer and a Region to Country drill-down.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "16pt"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "center"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "- Renamed the 44 indicators to short, readable names.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "16pt"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "center"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "- Created four categories (GDP Category, Population Category, Development Level, Growth Indicator Category), using No Data for unknown values, each with a numeric order column so that Power BI sorts them logically instead of alphabetically.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "16pt"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "center"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "- Added a Remove Duplicates step on Country as a safeguard (it removed no rows), which protects the one-to-one relationships.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "16pt"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "center"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "- Split the cleaned staging table into 8 subject tables (Geography, Population, Health, Economy, Trade_Finance, Energy, Infrastructure, Military). The staging table is not loaded into the model, so no data is duplicated.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "16pt"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "center"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "center"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
